cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VisualChem in teaching, research, or derivative work, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "VisualChem: Narrative Visualizations for University Chemistry"
abstract: >-
  VisualChem is an open-source project that connects macroscopic phenomena,
  submicroscopic models, and symbolic representations through explorable
  stories for university chemistry. Software is licensed under the MIT
  License. Original educational prose, story scripts, and explanatory graphics
  are licensed under CC BY 4.0 as described in LICENSE-CONTENT.md.
